From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:22:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 92/93] recomp: preserve return delay slots across function
 boundaries

FIFA Street's discovered 0x1e8480 entry split the real addiu sp,sp,0x30 delay instruction from JR RA at 0x1e847c. A synthetic NOP left the caller using the callee's stack frame, predicting the repeated 0x1e83e4 epilogue and v0=0x2ae7c8 seen in the manual skill-move fault. Decode the actual slot beyond the ownership boundary and retain it during discovery/reslicing.

The split-symbol ELF regression failed before the fix. Tests also cover discovery/reslicing and an optional typed-store observer carrying store PC, width and value for the host's saved-RA watch. No FPU behavior changes.

Verified rx build, rx test --full (57/57), and one rx run --match --seconds 60 with PS2X_WATCH_RA_STOMP=1: 50.0 game FPS, 50.0 presents/s, zero underruns, no fault or guard anomaly. Manual skill-move confirmation remains pending.

